cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper."
title: "PolSAR Ship Detection by Knowledge-Distillation-Guided Symbolic Regression"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a feedback learning-based polarimetric scattering
  representation for PolSAR ship detection: a lightweight MLP teacher distils
  pixel-level hard labels into a continuous ship-membership surface, and an
  evolutionary symbolic-regression student fits it under an explicit
  accuracy-complexity trade-off.
